# Same-origin default (""): the Vite dev server proxies /api to the backend
# (see vite.config.ts). Set an absolute origin only when the console is
# served from a different origin than the API (then the backend needs
# explicit CORS configuration, which it does not have by default).
# NEVER put secrets (API keys, PIN hashes, session secrets) in VITE_ vars.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
